  "body": "Perched in an elevated position to capture truly breathtaking views, this exceptional freehold residence offers an unmatched blend of luxury, space, and coastal lifestyle. Overlooking Long Bay, the sparkling ocean, and distant islands, the home is designed to maximise its outlook while delivering effortless family living and refined entertaining. From the moment you arrive through electric gates, the sense of scale and sophistication is immediately apparent, setting the tone for what lies beyond.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Grand entrance featuring a striking chandelier and elegant architectural detailing\r\n* Ample on-site parking for 5+ vehicles plus double internal access garage\r\n* Secure electric gated entry for privacy and peace of mind\r\n* Designer kitchen with premium appliances, scullery, and separate pantry\r\n* Expansive open-plan living with feature lighting and marble accents throughout\r\n* Beautiful long feature fireplace anchoring the main lounge\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to large entertaining areas with covered spaces\r\n* Stunning outdoor setting with swimming pool, perfect for year-round enjoyment\r\n* Downstairs guest bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite\r\n* Spacious upper-level bedrooms designed for comfort and privacy\r\n* Luxurious master suite with deck access, panoramic views, feature lighting, expansive walk-in wardrobe, and a beautifully appointed ensuite with bath and shower\r\n* Stylish family bathroom with additional bathtub\r\n* Dedicated study/home office on the top floor\r\n* High-spec finishes including built-in cabinetry, designer lighting, and quality detailing throughout\r\n\r\nPositioned in a highly sought-after coastal community, the home is just moments from Long Bay Village, local shops, cafes, and restaurants, as well as the stunning Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Regional Park, and the Long Bay Surf Club.\r\n\r\nZoned for excellent local schools including Long Bay College, Long Bay Primary School, and Northcross Intermediate, this property offers an outstanding lifestyle opportunity for families seeking space, security, and premium coastal living in a safe and welcoming neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files:",
